(8668,'itIT','Yes... the worm''s skin will make for an excellent protective layer.  Combined with the strongest parts from the Qiraji we''ve destroyed on our way here, this should make for a formidable piece of armor.  May it aid you in facing the unspeakable horrors that await inside!'),
